        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching-repro-package-3>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching-repro-package-4> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching-source-traceability> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Murray (1926a, 1926b), Zamir (1976) & Sherman (1981) minimum-work vascular cube law & arterial branching angles — Source and data traceability: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`datasets/vascular_cube_law_branching/` vendors the reference JSON, the CC BY 4.0 specimen, `paper_citations.bib` (now 7 entries, L1-77), `scout_manifest.json`, the new `fahraeus_lindqvist_retinal_cup_reference.json` (Pries 1992 coefficients, parity table, generalised stationarity formulas, cup geometry, DOI-verification flags) and a README with an explicit \"Caveats carried for audit\" section (L30-33); runtime SHA-256 verification of the specimen (`verify_dataset_integrity`, L93-114). Deductions: the three Pass 3 DOIs (Pries 1992, Fåhraeus & Lindqvist 1931, Hubbard 1999) were recalled offline and are flagged as unverified in the bib, JSON and script header (L17-20) (-4); Zamir, Medeiros & Cunningham (1979), the stated source of J01-J08, has no bib entry and no DOI, and the table has no page/figure pin (-4); the Sherman (1981) hierarchy (JSON L72-80) is generated from r_g = 82 um * 2^(-g/3) and the 82 um root radius is not pinned to a page (-2); `EXPECTED_SHA256` (L78-80) pins only the specimen JPG — neither reference JSON is hash-pinned (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
