    pk1:evidenceAgainst "1959-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching.py L17–L20: Header states the three Pass 3 DOIs were recalled, not verified online <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/1959-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching.py#L17-L20>",
        "datasets/vascular_cube_law_branching/vascular_cube_law_branching_reference.json L72–L90: Sherman hierarchy generated (not digitised); J01-J08 'Zamir 1979' rows without page/figure provenance and with a Murray-prediction column <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/028758bc/datasets/vascular_cube_law_branching/vascular_cube_law_branching_reference.json#L72-L90>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-murray-vascular-cube-law-branching-source-traceability-1>,
